{#- The user turn of the `chat` prompt source. The model's chat template wraps it, then a prefill
    ending in "(" makes an option label the next token. Variables: type, instructions, state,
    options (key, description, label). -#}
Read the content, then answer the question by choosing one option.

Content:
{% if state is string %}{{ state }}{% else %}{{ state | tojson }}{% endif %}

Question: {% if instructions is string %}{{ instructions }}{% else %}{{ instructions | tojson }}{% endif %}
{%- if type == "score" %}
Rate it on this scale, from lowest to highest.
{%- endif %}

Options:
{%- for option in options %}
({{ option.label }}) {% if type == "noul" %}{{ "Yes" if option.key == "true" else "No" }}{% elif type == "choice" %}{{ option.key }}{% endif %}
{%- if option.description is not none %}{{ ": " if type != "score" else "" }}{{ option.description }}{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}

Reply with the letter of the option in parentheses.
